OL,3,AYemen's Houthis reportedly seize
OL,4,Astrategic Red Sea port of Mokha
OL,5,
OL,6,FYemen's Houthi movement has seized the
OL,7,Fstrategic Red Sea port city of Mokha
OL,8,Ffrom Saudi-backed pro-government
OL,9,Fforces, military sources say.
OL,11,FThe capture of Mokha would bring the
OL,12,FIran-backed group closer to controlling
OL,13,Fthe Bab al-Mandab strait, a key
OL,14,Fshipping route about 75km (46 miles) to
OL,15,Fthe south that links the Red Sea to the
OL,16,FGulf of Aden.
OL,18,FHundreds of people have reportedly been
OL,19,Fkilled and thousands displaced since
OL,20,Fthe Houthis launched an offensive in
OL,21,Fthe south-western coastal region a week
OL,22,Fago.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
