OL,3,AYemen's Houthis reportedly seize
OL,4,Astrategic Red Sea port of Mokha
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt the same time, there has been a
OL,7,Fsignificant escalation in the Houthis'
OL,8,Fconflict with neighbouring Saudi Arabia
OL,9,Fthat has contributed to a surge in
OL,10,Fglobal oil prices.
